-- statement:
--   Given Brownian/Poisson path independence and the compact-uniform small-jump approximation, the Gaussian, large-jump and small-jump processes have joint independence as entire random paths.
-- source:
--   Kyprianou (2006), Chapter 2, Theorem 2.1, Lévy–Itô component verification

